顺序分析'。具体次要疗效终点（如6分钟步行距离、KCCQ等）未在允许来源中列出，未写入正文。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（剂量选择）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_bfcd0eec6505_56aa457070c6d8e8","section_number":"3.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:40a641f338f5d83455196279","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_5ce6022c419cf72077e2:r6:d11f75abadf3bca7","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:46d82ed9e2e3ef","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3809927f2ae07b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5f4a227d6404a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:abb423601f76d0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261005162354_aa00a949","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"恢复本章节正文与当前项目来源的证据绑定后重新核对。","category":"mapping_failed","gap_id":"gap:evidence-binding","missing_source_classes":[],"target":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_bfcd0eec6505_8ef926863eb742b3"}],"heading":"探索性目的和探索性终点","missing_source_classes":["支持本章节正文的当前项目直接来源"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本次输出未能把正文绑定到有效证据；需补充或重新绑定支持本章节的当前项目直接来源。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_bfcd0eec6505_8ef926863eb742b3","section_number":"3.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:40a641f338f5d83455196279","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_5ce6022c419cf72077e2:r6:d11f75abadf3bca7","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:46d82ed9e2e3ef","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3809927f2ae07b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5f4a227d6404a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:abb423601f76d0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7"]},{"ai_ru